omposer"&&e.attachments===void 0&&_dr(e.text)}var a=(e)=>s(e)&&e.turnId!==void 0&&!e.wait;var h="enter to interrupt and send \xB7 ctrl+x then enter to queue";var p="focus_mode";var u=`<responsive-mode>
Responsive mode is on. Reply to the user's message above right away, before
